<title>USA: U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CST - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CST - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boxed beef firm on light demand and offerings. Select and Choice rib, chuck, and round cuts firm, while loin cuts higher. Beef trimmings firm on light to moderate demand and offerings. - USDA</p>
<p>-----</p>
<p>-----</p>
<p>170 Fab Lds  CH 1-3	CH 1-3	SE 1-3	SE 1-3</p>
<p> 35 50s Lds  550/700     700/850     550/700     700/850</p>
<p>40 Grd Lds ---------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Values =     103.62	103.39	 98.54	 97.79</p>
<p>Changes	   0.58	  1.13	  0.76	  1.08</p>
<p>Rib	  152.39	151.66	141.23	140.99</p>
<p>Chuck	 70.74	 68.88	 74.11	 69.47</p>
<p>Round	 93.54	 93.54	 91.89	 91.89</p>
<p>Loin	 164.46	166.36	143.29	146.34</p>
<p>Brisket     65.90	 65.90	 67.27	 67.27</p>
<p>Shrt Plate  65.31	 65.24	 65.54	 65.38</p>
<p>Flank	 59.22	 59.22	 57.05	 57.05</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
